# Facts about Nessa Quill.

@fact nessa.editor
tier: surface
text: Editor of the Lumen Ledger, with a quill that writes on its own.

@fact nessa.quill
tier: personal
hint: In your second year, visit the Ledger Office in the evening.
unlock: seen(nessa_burnout) > 0
text: Left unsupervised, her quill starts inventing the news.

@fact nessa.interview
tier: personal
hint: Become friends with her.
unlock: rel(nessa) >= 12
text: Nobody has interviewed the headmistress in twenty years. She means to be the first.

@fact nessa.string
tier: secret
hint: Follow the Hollow Star, and stay on good terms with her.
unlock: seen(nessa_hollow_story) > 0
text: Her office wall is covered in red string around a sketch of a black star.

@fact nessa.press
tier: personal
unlock: seen(nessa_paper_threatened) > 0
text: She would chain herself to the printing press before letting anyone shut the Ledger.

@fact nessa.off_record
tier: secret
hint: Court her.
unlock: seen(nessa_confession) > 0
text: Her quill takes down everything, and stops for only two words: off the record.

@fact nessa.planted
tier: personal
unlock: seen(nessa_fact_check) > 0
text: She plants one error in every proof she asks you to check, to see whether you'll find it.

@fact nessa.type
tier: personal
hint: Spend a break in the countryside, and call at the Almanac Printer's.
unlock: seen(almanac_type_case) > 0
text: She learned to set type backwards before she could write forwards, above her mother's press in the countryside. At the type case she doesn't say a single headline.

@fact nessa.first_story
tier: personal
hint: Keep calling at the Almanac Printer's.
unlock: seen(almanac_first_notice) > 0
text: Her first story was a notice for a lost dog called Biscuit, set when she was seven. The dog came home. She has been unbearable ever since, and says it's the job.

@fact nessa.almanac
tier: secret
hint: Call at the Almanac Printer's once you are friends.
unlock: seen(almanac_short_page) > 0
text: Every seventh year the valley's almanac is printed a page short, always the harvest page. Her mother says the old press always did that. Nessa doesn't believe her.

@fact nessa.why_left
tier: personal
hint: Spend a break in the countryside while you are on good terms.
unlock: seen(nessa_country_green) > 0
text: She left the valley because nothing in it was ever news. Lately she wonders whether that was the news.
